98165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke","html_url":"https://github.com/ZoeLocke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZoeLocke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T18:59:31Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T18:59:31Z","body":"I have the Experimental Virtual Keyboard option ticked and it's still not working :(\n\nEdge browser, accessed via a OnePlus and a Samsung Galaxy","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2873683529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764213644","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106057#issuecomment-3764213644","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106057","id":3764213644,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gXVeM","user":{"login":"blkc","id":7827466,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4Mjc0NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7827466?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc","html_url":"https://github.com/blkc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blkc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T19:02:06Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T19:03:09Z","body":"After encountering this last year as well in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108355, I think this might be the root cause. Godot uses a contentEditable `div` in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_input.js for text input, which doesn't reliably trigger virtual keyboards on mobile browsers particularly on Safari.\n\nhttps://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/VirtualKeyboard_API#control_the_virtual_keyboard_on_contenteditable_elements\nhttps://caniuse.com/mdn-api_virtualkeyboard\n\nI tried to produce a workaround that demonstrates the fix:\nrepo: https://github.com/blkc/godot-mobile-keyboard-fix\ndemo: https://blkc.github.io/godot-mobile-keyboard-fix\n\nDemo shows side-by-side comparison between the 2\n\nWould a PR modifying library_godot_input.js to use textarea on mobile browsers be acceptable?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764213644/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]